font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"&gt;$&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:normal;width:14.79%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"&gt;&lt;p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;79.88 &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:normal;width:2.09%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"&gt;&lt;p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:12pt;margin:0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10pt;visibility:hidden;"&gt;&#x200b;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:12pt;margin:0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:8pt;visibility:hidden;"&gt;&#x200b;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"&gt;The total intrinsic value of options exercised during 2025, 2024 and 2023 was $11.9 million, $11.3 million and $9.2&lt;span style="white-space:pre-wrap;"&gt; million, respectively.  The total fair value of shares vested during 2025, 2024 and 2023 was &lt;/span&gt;$11.7 million, $11.1 million and $11.7 million, respectively.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:12pt;line-height:9pt;margin:0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;visibility:hidden;"&gt;&#x200b;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"&gt;All unexercised options at December 27, 2025 have an exercise price equal to the fair market value on the date of the grant.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:12pt;margin:0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10pt;visibility:hidden;"&gt;&#x200b;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:12pt;margin:0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10pt;"&gt;Compensation expense of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10pt;"&gt;$2,283,300&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10pt;"&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10pt;"&gt;$1,988,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10pt;"&gt; and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10pt;"&gt;$1,952,400&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10pt;white-space:pre-wrap;"&gt; relating to the vested portion of the fair value of stock options granted was expensed to &#x201c;Selling, General and Administrative Expenses&#x201d; in 2025, 2024 and 2023, respectively.  As of December 27, 2025, the Company had &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10pt;"&gt;$6.2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10pt;"&gt; million of total unrecognized compensation expense related to stock options that is expected to be recognized over the remaining weighted average vesting period of approximately &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10pt;"&gt;3.2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10pt;"&gt; years.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</us-gaap:ShareholdersEquityAndShareBasedPaymentsTextBlock>
